Identifiable data are deleted as described in J1.6. Consent records are kept for {{ p.retention_years }} years after the project ends, then destroyed.
Anonymised data are kept for {{ p.retention_years }} years after the project ends, in line with UCL policy{% if p.open_data %}; anonymised data deposited in the UCL Research Data Repository follow the repository's retention policy{% endif %}.
Electronic files are permanently deleted from all storage locations including recycle bins and synced copies; paper is shredded via UCL's confidential waste service. The PI is responsible for deletion on schedule.
